  "ingredients": [
    "1 (10 pound) whole turkey",
    "0.5 cup olive oil",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh sage",
    "1 tablespoon fresh thyme leaves",
    "1 tablespoon finely chopped fresh rosemary",
    "1 tablespoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon crushed black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Place a roasting rack on a rimmed baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place turkey, breast-side down, on a cutting board. Using a pair of sharp heavy-duty kitchen shears, cut along one side of backbone.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yGIMxhaqiAaVbfFkYt5YgsOKj6U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245534-roast-spatchcock-turkey-step02-1-3736bac092b246cf8e19bc6b88f16ec4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245534/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Repeat on the other side of backbone. Remove backbone and reserve for making turkey stock for gravy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tFq7DTuhQj-k-vhFQ7WTkzTV7C0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245534-roast-spatchcock-turkey-step-02-3-8f2b7cd6c2374b219faa82e885c62ef3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245534/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press firmly down onto both sides of turkey breast to flatten.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iebleEKHo7GuXafpC3edayp3giI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245534-roast-spatchcock-turkey-step-02-4-f65ef31612e247f4a144a023aea38c1f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245534/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put turkey, breast-side up, on the roasting rack. Tuck wing tips behind breast. Pat skin dry; rub oil over entire turkey. Season with sage, thyme, rosemary, salt, and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Fi91z74bmR6TuQdxKTYdrp67qEQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245534-roast-spatchcock-turkey-step-03-93091a8a3b394d419a644c8c18d779fa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245534/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast in the preheated oven for 1 hour 30 minutes, rotating the baking sheet every 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Increase the oven temperature to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C); continue roasting until skin is crisp and golden, about 15 minutes more. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part of the thigh should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Roi1CNm47WWlIhfUCj6g-aV9kWE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245534-roast-spatchcock-turkey-step-05-4de1e3c029634e78b48d991972fad669.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245534/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove turkey from the oven, cover loosely with a double sheet of aluminum foil; let rest, 10 to 15 minutes before slicing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9zcTRjoPSjeSR_BMrRfCc__54ng=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245534-roast-spatchcock-turkey-step-06-2-67a2033a3c3b4d23840ea4f50ac1b05c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245534/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
